<view class="page tab-page account-page">
  <view class="ambient">
    <view class="ambient-blob ambient-a"></view>
    <view class="ambient-blob ambient-b"></view>
    <view class="ambient-blob ambient-c"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="account-hero">
    <view class="account-avatar">{{initial}}</view>
    <view class="account-copy">
      <view class="account-name">{{loggedIn ? username : '未登录'}}</view>
      <view class="account-sub">{{loggedIn ? roleText : '登录后可收藏店铺并管理个人内容'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="card account-card">
    <view class="account-title">登录泥电美食地图</view>
    <view class="account-copy-text">
      小程序沿用网页端账号体系，使用注册邮箱登录，无需重新注册。
    </view>
    <view class="primary-button" bindtap="login">登录账号</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="card account-card">
    <view class="account-title">账号已登录</view>
    <view class="account-copy-text">
      当前小程序已接入店铺浏览、点评发布与互动、收藏和消息；账号信息与网页端共用。
    </view>

    <view class="account-menu" data-tab="reviews" bindtap="openMyContent">
      <view class="account-menu-copy">
        <view class="account-menu-label">我的点评</view>
        <view class="account-menu-sub">查看已发布点评与对应店铺</view>
      </view>
      <view class="account-menu-arrow">›</view>
    </view>

    <view class="account-menu" data-tab="favorites" bindtap="openMyContent">
      <view class="account-menu-copy">
        <view class="account-menu-label">我的收藏</view>
        <view class="account-menu-sub">查看收藏的餐厅与食堂</view>
      </view>
      <view class="account-menu-arrow">›</view>
    </view>

    <view class="ghost-button logout-button" bindtap="confirmLogout">
      {{loggingOut ? '退出中…' : '退出登录'}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="account-note">
    小程序不会获取微信头像、昵称、手机号或 openid；登录仅使用注册邮箱与密码。
  </view>
</view>
